ntfy Flutter

This product includes translated strings and Android behavior adapted from
ntfy Android (https://github.com/binwiederhier/ntfy-android), created by
Philipp C. Heckel and contributors and licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

The generated assets/i18n.json file is derived from ntfy Android string
resources. Android notification channels, vibration patterns, and broadcast
contracts are implemented for compatibility with that project.

The Apache License 2.0 is included in the repository LICENSE file.

Inter, Hanken Grotesk, and JetBrains Mono are distributed under the SIL Open
Font License 1.1. The license text is included at assets/fonts/OFL.txt.
